        "created_at": "2015-01-28T20:41:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So when Wraith enters Absolute Zero's Impaling Structure Hazard Space, Absolute Zero attacks her. &nbsp;If she has Combat Stance, does she get to retaliate on Absolute Zero? &nbsp;If she does, I assume her Combat Stance attack still takes things into account like range and LOS to Absolute Zero.</p>",
